# Data layer

## Prisma

- **`prisma/schema.prisma`** is the source of truth (~35 models). Regenerate client with `pnpm exec prisma generate` (output: `src/generated/prisma`).
- Prefer **`pnpm exec prisma db push`** in local dev if migrations are not checked in yet.

## Naming you will see

- Catalog SKU: **`Item`** (legacy docs may say “WARItem”).
- Stock in bin: **`BinStockItem`** (not “BinItem”).
- Order/ledger fields often still use Prisma name **`warItemId`** — it refers to **`Item.id`**.
- **`BoxLine.itemId`** references **`BinStockItem`** in the current schema (not the catalog item id).

## Entities

- One domain folder under `src/lib/entities/` per area; small focused exports (e.g. `create-warehouse.ts`, `get-warehouses.ts`).
- When stock/logging ships: **UAE + BOE + ILE** in a **single transaction**; logs are append-only (no updates/deletes on log rows).
